{title: Wash Over Me}
{artist: Jami Smith}
{key: G}

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Wash [D]over me, [G]wash [D]over [C]me

{comment: Verse}
[F2]Rain down [C2]Your favor on us
[F2]Lavish Your [C2]love upon us
[F2]Pour out Your [C2]presence on us
[C2]Let me taste Your mercy in the rain [D/F#]

{comment: Bridge}
[C2]Only You can take [Em]this heart [D]
[D]Only You can take this mind
[C2]Only You can [Em]take this life and [D]make it look like Jesus
